<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Hamant et al. (2008) & Heisler et al. (2010) pressurized SAM shell stress tensor, cortical microtubule alignment, PIN1-auxin phyllotactic mechanics, and (Pass 3) 3D multi-layered L1/L2/L3 Voronoi cell mesh with dynamic division planes (Arabidopsis thaliana (shoot apical meristem L1 epidermis, L2/L3 corpus & floral primordia))" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-4>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-5> ;
    schema:about "Arabidopsis thaliana (shoot apical meristem L1 epidermis, L2/L3 corpus & floral primordia)" ;
    schema:additionalProperty "does_not_claim: A finite-element or vertex-model mechanical solution: the 3D mesh has cell-centre degrees of freedom only, no wall bending, no cell-volume constraint, stress-free insertion of new contacts, and does not reproduce the radial growth of the thin-shell anisotropy magnitude",
        "does_not_claim: That the 84.9% PIN1-CMT co-alignment, the 0.91 post-ablation circumferential fraction, the lateral-compression S_CMT or the 50 um calibrated dome radius are emergent model predictions (they are imposed by hard-coded noise/fit/fudge/calibration constants, see remediation)",
        "reconstructed_in_script: 168-cell paraboloidal L1 dome coupled Auxin-PIN1-CMT ODE simulator with the L1 stress field supplied by the 3D mesh (Pass 3) or by the Pass 2 analytic field (ablation); antisymmetric active flux conservation; 137.06 deg golden-angle phyllotaxis",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Automated segmentation of the Toluidine-Blue Arabidopsis SAM histological section (539 tunica-corpus nuclei, L1 dome contour & saddle crease) and apex-registered comparison of the mesh outer-L1 profile with the calibrated specimen contour",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Doubly-curved thin-shell Laplace-Young principal stress solver across all 4 SAM curvature zones + Fokker-Planck CMT nematic order S_CMT(A_sigma) + transverse-isotropic Lockhart cell-wall yielding",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Kirsch circular laser-ablation wound stress redistribution (rim hoop stress doubling), lateral micro-vise compression, and 20 ug/mL oryzalin negative control; the post-ablation circumferential fraction is a fitted exponential relaxation, not a simulated reorientation",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Pass 3: 526-cell four-sheet L1/L2/L3a/L3b 3D Voronoi cell-centre mesh with wall springs, turgor on exterior faces, Jacobi-relaxed quasi-statics, per-cell virial tension tensor, Lockhart creep, division at volume doubling with Louveaux-2016 tension or Besson-Dumais-2011 Gibbs anticlinal planes (L1/L2) and 3D Gibbs planes (L3); L1 load share vs Lean Law 4; stiffness-ratio sweep",
        "reported_in_source: Hamant et al. (2008) Science 322:1650-1655 pressurized shell principal tensile stress tensor across spherical dome (sigma_theta = sigma_m = PR/2t), cylindrical flank (sigma_theta = 2*sigma_z = PR/t), and negative-Gaussian-curvature primordium boundary saddle crease, driving cortical microtubule (CMT) alignment and anisotropic Lockhart wall yielding",
        "reported_in_source: Heisler et al. (2010) PLoS Biol 8:e1000516 co-alignment between PIN1 auxin efflux carrier polarity and CMT orientation across L1 meristem cells (84.5% within +-30 deg) and synchronous circumferential reorientation following single-cell laser ablation",
        "reported_in_source: Louveaux et al. (2016) PNAS 113:E4294 shoot-apex division planes follow maximal tensile stress; 65-77% of planes are the shortest plane and 81% of divisions are symmetric (smaller daughter 40-50%); Reddy et al. (2004) L1/L2 divide anticlinally, corpus periclinally and anticlinally",
        "transfer_boundary: Axisymmetric/saddle thin-shell stress laws, 168-cell paraboloidal L1 dome and the 3D paraboloidal cell-centre mesh mapped to a single longitudinal histological SAM section; division-plane statistics compared with literature values (Louveaux 2016, Reddy 2004), not with the specimen" ;
    pk:anatomicalStructure "Auxin flux vein / phyllotactic primordium in Arabidopsis thaliana" ;
    pk:aristotelianEfficientCause "4. Polar Auxin & Turgor Stress" ;
    pk:aristotelianMegistonGenos "III. Phyta (Embryophyta)" ;
    pk:aristotelianPoionForm "Spirals, Veins & Puzzle Cells" ;
    pk:aristotelianPosonLaw "Golden Angle / Auxin Flux" ;
    pk:aristotelianSubalternClass "Angiospermae & Gymnospermae" ;
    pk:biologicalGenus "Arabidopsis" ;
