        "2008-hamant-meristem-microtubule-stress.py L1980–L2011: Mesh validation: flank hoop alignment 0.81, L1 load share 0.7144 vs 0.7143 (Law 4), but anisotropy-vs-membrane-law RMSE 0.072 and apex anisotropy 0.059 are failed comparisons <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2008-hamant-meristem-microtubule-stress.py#L1980-L2011>",
        "2008-hamant-meristem-microtubule-stress.py L2012–L2043: Division-plane statistics: shortest-plane 0.384 vs Louveaux 0.71 (p = 5e-18) and symmetric 0.976 vs 0.81 are failed comparisons; anticlinal 1.0 holds by construction <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2008-hamant-meristem-microtubule-stress.py#L2012-L2043>" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-measurement-cylindrical-flank-hoop-to-axial-stress-ratio>,
